# try-send returns [Result.Ok] on success, [Full] when channel is at capacity
# Phase 3: try-send builtin (T-813)
#
# try-send is non-blocking: succeeds immediately on an empty channel.
# Returns [Result.Ok] (no payload) on success. This is serializable.
# Channel is accessed only internally by try-send — not serialized.
[
  ch: [channel 10]
  result: [try-send ch 42]
]
.result
=== out
Variant(Result.Ok, Null)
